<title>USA: Brunswick Corp sets $250 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Brunswick Corp sets $250 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Brunswick Corp was priced on Thursday, via Merrill Lynch &amp; Co Inc, according to market sources.</p>
<p>BORROWER BRUNSWICK CORP</p>
<p>AMT $250 MLN	 COUPON 6.75 PCT   MATURITY 12/15/2006</p>
<p>TYPE  NOTES	  ISS PRICE 99.14   FIRST PAY DATE 06/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S BAA1  YIELD  6.87 PCT   PAY FREQ  SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB-PLUS  SPREAD 65 BP	CALLABLE  NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
</text>
